This is the AROS 64-bit porting of Homeworld.
It uses SDL2 library and the AROS project is built using
Code::Blocks 25. This fork fixes some issues that may occur in
the original repository
(https://github.com/HomeworldSDL/HomeworldSDL).

Homeworld requires a copy of the data taken from an original
installation on Windows platform. Four files (Homeworld.big,
HW_Comp.vce, HW_Music.wxd and Update.big) and one folder (Movies)
must be copied inside the folder of the game.

Source code and additional information are available here
https://github.com/sonountaleban/Homeworld

